/-!
# The orthogonal orbit-sum fold of a simply laced root system

Let `P` be a finite reduced crystallographic root system over a linearly ordered field `R`, `b` a
simply laced base of `P`, and `σ` an automorphism of `P` permuting the simple roots of `b` such
that distinct simple roots in the same `σ`-orbit are orthogonal. Following Stembridge (Claim 1),
this file constructs an `OrbitSumRealization` of `(P, b, σ)` on the fixed weight space
`LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap` and its linear dual.

The construction proceeds in four stages:

1. **Commuting reflection products and orbit reflections.** Over any commutative ring, the
   reflections indexed by a finite set of pairwise orthogonal roots commute in `P.weylGroup`, so
   their `Finset.noncommProd` defines an involution `RootPairing.orthogonalReflectionProd`. When an
   orbit `RootPairing.orbitIndices P σ i` is orthogonal to its basepoint `i`, automorphism
   invariance upgrades this to full pairwise orthogonality of the orbit, yielding the block
   reflection `RootPairing.orbitReflection`. It commutes with `σ` in `P.Aut` and acts on every
   `σ`-fixed weight `x` as `x - P.coroot' i x • P.orbitSum σ i`.
2. **Stembridge height descent and unrestricted orbit orthogonality.** Using the positive
   definiteness of `b.simplyLacedForm`, every root index `k` is conjugate under the subgroup
   generated by the simple-orbit reflections to a simple root in `b.support`. Since these orbit
   reflections commute with `σ`, pairwise orthogonality transports from simple orbits to **all**
   root orbits (`RootPairing.pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced`), and every
   orbit sum has squared norm `2 * #(P.orbitIndices σ k)` under `b.simplyLacedForm`.
3. **Folded root system.** Normalized inner products against `(b.simplyLacedForm hsimply)` define
   coroot functionals on the fixed space without choosing orbit representatives, and evaluating at
   any lift `k` of `γ` recovers `P.coroot' k`. Mathlib's `RootPairing.mk''` and
   `RootPairing.isRootSystem_mk''` assemble the folded root system.
4. **Folded base and reducedness.** Linear independence of the simple-orbit sums, nonpositivity of
   off-diagonal folded Cartan integers, and reflection descent feed
   `RootPairing.Base.mkOfPairwiseLEZero` to build the folded base; conjugating an arbitrary folded
   root into the folded base and applying
   `RootPairing.Base.eq_one_or_neg_one_of_mem_support_of_smul_mem` proves `IsReduced`.

By `Subsingleton (P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)`, the explicit formulas for folded coroots, Cartan
pairings, and reflections hold automatically for **every** `F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ`.

## Main definitions

* `RootPairing.orthogonalReflectionProd`: the product in `P.weylGroup` of the reflections in a
  finite set of pairwise orthogonal roots.
* `RootPairing.orbitReflection`: the product of reflections across a pairwise orthogonal `σ`-orbit.
* `RootPairing.orthogonalOrbitSumRealization`: the orbit-sum realization of a simply laced root
  system under a base-preserving automorphism with orthogonal simple orbits.

## Main results

* `RootPairing.ncard_inversions_mul_orthogonalReflectionProd`: right-multiplying `w` by the
  product of pairwise orthogonal simple reflections in `inversions P b w` drops the inversion
  count by `#s`.
* `RootPairing.pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced`: **every** `σ`-orbit (not just
  the simple ones) is pairwise orthogonal.
* `RootPairing.simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_self` and
  `RootPairing.simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_orbitSum`: `(b.simplyLacedForm hsimply)` gives
  `P.orbitSum σ k` squared length `2 * #(P.orbitIndices σ k)` and pairs two orbit sums to the total
  ambient Cartan pairing between their orbits.
* `RootPairing.OrbitSumRealization.coroot_toFoldedIndices_apply`,
  `RootPairing.OrbitSumRealization.pairingIn_toFoldedIndices`,
  `RootPairing.OrbitSumRealization.pairing_toFoldedIndices_eq_div_card`, and
  `RootPairing.OrbitSumRealization.coe_reflection_toFoldedIndices_apply`: explicit formulas for the
  coroots, integer and normalized Cartan pairings, and reflections of any realization
  `F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ`.

## References

* J. R. Stembridge, *Folding by automorphisms*, note of 20 August 2008, Claim 1 (pages 1–2).
-/

public section

namespace RootPairing

open Finset TauCeti

/-! ### Products of commuting orthogonal reflections -/

section OrthogonalProd

variable {ι R M N : Type*} [CommRing R] [AddCommGroup M] [Module R M] [AddCommGroup N] [Module R N]
  (P : RootPairing ι R M N)

/-- The product in `P.weylGroup` of the reflections indexed by a finite set of pairwise orthogonal
roots. Because orthogonal reflections commute, no ordering of `s` is needed. -/
noncomputable def orthogonalReflectionProd (s : Finset ι)
    (hs : (s : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal) : P.weylGroup :=
  s.noncommProd (weylGroup.ofIdx P) fun _ hi _ hj hne ↦
    weylGroup.commute_ofIdx_of_isOrthogonal P (hs hi hj hne)

@[simp]
theorem orthogonalReflectionProd_empty (hs : ((∅ : Finset ι) : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal) :
    P.orthogonalReflectionProd ∅ hs = 1 :=
  noncommProd_empty _ _

theorem orthogonalReflectionProd_cons {a : ι} {s : Finset ι} (ha : a ∉ s)
    (hs : ((cons a s ha : Finset ι) : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal) :
    P.orthogonalReflectionProd (cons a s ha) hs =
      weylGroup.ofIdx P a *
        P.orthogonalReflectionProd s (hs.mono fun _ h ↦ mem_cons.mpr (.inr h)) :=
  noncommProd_cons s a (weylGroup.ofIdx P) ha _

/-- A product of pairwise orthogonal root reflections subtracts the orthogonal reflection terms
independently. -/
theorem orthogonalReflectionProd_smul (s : Finset ι)
    (hs : (s : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal) (x : M) :
    P.orthogonalReflectionProd s hs • x = x - ∑ j ∈ s, P.coroot' j x • P.root j := by
  induction s using Finset.cons_induction with
  | empty => simp
  | cons a t ha ih =>
    have ht : (t : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal := hs.mono fun _ h ↦ mem_cons.mpr (.inr h)
    rw [orthogonalReflectionProd_cons, mul_smul, ih ht, weylGroup.ofIdx_smul,
      Equiv.reflection_smul, reflection_apply, map_sub, map_sum]
    have hzero : ∑ j ∈ t, P.coroot' a (P.coroot' j x • P.root j) = 0 := by
      refine sum_eq_zero fun j hj ↦ ?_
      have horth : P.IsOrthogonal a j :=
        hs (mem_cons_self a t) (mem_cons.mpr (.inr hj)) (fun h ↦ ha (h ▸ hj))
      rw [map_smul, root_coroot'_eq_pairing, horth.2, smul_zero]
    rw [hzero, sub_zero, sum_cons, sub_sub, add_comm]

/-- A product of commuting involutive reflections is an involution. -/
@[simp]
theorem orthogonalReflectionProd_mul_self (s : Finset ι)
    (hs : (s : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal) :
    P.orthogonalReflectionProd s hs * P.orthogonalReflectionProd s hs = 1 := by
  induction s using Finset.cons_induction with
  | empty => simp
  | cons a t ha ih =>
    have ht : (t : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal := hs.mono fun _ h ↦ mem_cons.mpr (.inr h)
    have hcomm : Commute (weylGroup.ofIdx P a) (P.orthogonalReflectionProd t ht) :=
      noncommProd_commute t (weylGroup.ofIdx P) _ (weylGroup.ofIdx P a) fun j hj ↦
        weylGroup.commute_ofIdx_of_isOrthogonal P
          (hs (mem_cons_self a t) (mem_cons.mpr (.inr hj)) fun h ↦ ha (h ▸ hj))
    rw [orthogonalReflectionProd_cons, mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc (P.orthogonalReflectionProd t ht),
      hcomm.symm.eq, mul_assoc, ih ht, mul_one, weylGroup.ofIdx_mul_self]

@[simp]
theorem orthogonalReflectionProd_inv (s : Finset ι)
    (hs : (s : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal) :
    (P.orthogonalReflectionProd s hs)⁻¹ = P.orthogonalReflectionProd s hs :=
  inv_eq_of_mul_eq_one_right (P.orthogonalReflectionProd_mul_self s hs)

/-- When `s` consists of pairwise orthogonal simple roots of `b`, `orthogonalReflectionProd`
preserves the positive roots outside `s`. -/
theorem weylGroupToPerm_orthogonalReflectionProd_mem_posRoots_diff [CharZero R] [IsDomain R]
    [Finite ι] [P.IsCrystallographic] [P.IsReduced] (b : P.Base)
    (s : Finset ι) (hs : (s : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal)
    (hsupp : (s : Set ι) ⊆ b.support) {k : ι} (hk : k ∈ posRoots P b \ s) :
    P.weylGroupToPerm (P.orthogonalReflectionProd s hs) k ∈ posRoots P b \ s := by
  induction s using Finset.cons_induction generalizing k with
  | empty => simpa using hk
  | cons a t ha ih =>
    have ht : (t : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal := hs.mono fun _ h ↦ mem_cons.mpr (.inr h)
    have ht_supp : (t : Set ι) ⊆ b.support := fun j hj ↦ hsupp (mem_cons.mpr (.inr hj))
    have ha_supp : a ∈ b.support := hsupp (mem_cons_self a t)
    have hk_t : k ∈ posRoots P b \ t := ⟨hk.1, fun h ↦ hk.2 (mem_cons.mpr (.inr h))⟩
    have hk' := ih ht ht_supp hk_t
    set k' := P.weylGroupToPerm (P.orthogonalReflectionProd t ht) k
    have hk'_ne_a : k' ≠ a := by
      intro hEq
      have ha_fix : P.weylGroupToPerm (P.orthogonalReflectionProd t ht) a = a := by
        apply P.root.injective
        rw [← P.weylGroup_apply_root, orthogonalReflectionProd_smul]
        have hz : ∑ j ∈ t, P.coroot' j (P.root a) • P.root j = 0 := by
          refine sum_eq_zero fun j hj ↦ ?_
          have horth : P.IsOrthogonal a j :=
            hs (mem_cons_self a t) (mem_cons.mpr (.inr hj)) fun h ↦ ha (h ▸ hj)
          rw [root_coroot'_eq_pairing, horth.1, zero_smul]
        rw [hz, sub_zero]
      have hk_eq_a : k = a :=
        (P.weylGroupToPerm (P.orthogonalReflectionProd t ht)).injective (hEq.trans ha_fix.symm)
      exact hk.2 (hk_eq_a ▸ mem_cons_self a t)
    rw [orthogonalReflectionProd_cons, P.weylGroupToPerm_ofIdx_mul_apply]
    have hpos : P.reflectionPerm a k' ∈ posRoots P b \ {a} :=
      (bijOn_reflectionPerm_posRoots_diff_singleton P b ha_supp).mapsTo ⟨hk'.1, hk'_ne_a⟩
    refine ⟨hpos.1, ?_⟩
    intro hmem
    rcases mem_cons.mp hmem with hEq | hmem_t
    · exact hpos.2 hEq
    · have horth : P.IsOrthogonal a (P.reflectionPerm a k') :=
        hs (mem_cons_self a t) (mem_cons.mpr (.inr hmem_t)) fun h ↦ ha (h ▸ hmem_t)
      have hfix : P.reflectionPerm a (P.reflectionPerm a k') = P.reflectionPerm a k' := by
        apply P.root.injective
        rw [root_reflectionPerm, reflection_apply, root_coroot'_eq_pairing, horth.2, zero_smul,
          sub_zero]
      rw [reflectionPerm_self] at hfix
      exact hk'.2 (hfix ▸ hmem_t)

/-- Right-multiplying `w` by the product of pairwise orthogonal simple reflections all belonging to
`inversions P b w` decreases `(inversions P b w).ncard` by `#s`. -/
theorem ncard_inversions_mul_orthogonalReflectionProd [CharZero R] [IsDomain R] [Finite ι]
    [P.IsCrystallographic] [P.IsReduced] (b : P.Base) (w : P.weylGroup) (s : Finset ι)
    (hs : (s : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal) (hsupp : (s : Set ι) ⊆ b.support)
    (hinv : ∀ j ∈ s, j ∈ inversions P b w) :
    (inversions P b (w * P.orthogonalReflectionProd s hs)).ncard + #s =
      (inversions P b w).ncard := by
  induction s using Finset.cons_induction generalizing w with
  | empty => simp
  | cons a t ha ih =>
    have ht : (t : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal := hs.mono fun _ h ↦ mem_cons.mpr (.inr h)
    have ht_supp : (t : Set ι) ⊆ b.support := fun j hj ↦ hsupp (mem_cons.mpr (.inr hj))
    have ha_supp : a ∈ b.support := hsupp (mem_cons_self a t)
    have ha_inv : a ∈ inversions P b w := hinv a (mem_cons_self a t)
    have hstep := ncard_inversions_mul_ofIdx_of_mem P w b ha_supp ha_inv
    have ht_inv : ∀ j ∈ t, j ∈ inversions P b (w * weylGroup.ofIdx P a) := by
      intro j hj
      have hj_inv : j ∈ inversions P b w := hinv j (mem_cons.mpr (.inr hj))
      have horth : P.IsOrthogonal a j :=
        hs (mem_cons_self a t) (mem_cons.mpr (.inr hj)) fun h ↦ ha (h ▸ hj)
      have hfix : P.reflectionPerm a j = j := by
        apply P.root.injective
        rw [root_reflectionPerm, reflection_apply, root_coroot'_eq_pairing, horth.2, zero_smul,
          sub_zero]
      rw [mem_inversions, weylGroupToPerm_mul_ofIdx_apply, hfix]
      exact (mem_inversions P b w j).mp hj_inv
    have hrec := ih (w * weylGroup.ofIdx P a) ht ht_supp ht_inv
    rw [orthogonalReflectionProd_cons, ← mul_assoc, card_cons]
    omega

end OrthogonalProd

/-! ### Orbit orthogonality and block reflections -/

section OrbitReflection

variable {ι R M N : Type*} [CommRing R] [AddCommGroup M] [Module R M] [AddCommGroup N] [Module R N]
  {P : RootPairing ι R M N}

private theorem indexEquiv_pow_apply (τ : P.Aut) (n : ℕ) (z : ι) :
    (τ.indexEquiv ^ n) z = (τ ^ n).indexEquiv z := by
  induction n with
  | zero => rfl
  | succ n ih =>
    rw [pow_succ', pow_succ', _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply, ih]
    rfl

variable [Finite ι] {σ : P.Aut}

/-- All coroots in a single `σ`-orbit agree on every `σ`-fixed weight. -/
theorem coroot'_eq_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_mem_fixedSubmodule {i j : ι}
    (hj : j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i) {x : M} (hx : x ∈ LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) :
    P.coroot' j x = P.coroot' i x := by
  obtain ⟨k, rfl⟩ := mem_orbitIndices_iff_exists_pow.mp hj
  have hx_fixed : ∀ n : ℕ, (σ ^ n).weightMap x = x := by
    intro n
    induction n with
    | zero => simp
    | succ n ih =>
      have hmul : (σ ^ (n + 1)).weightMap x = σ.weightMap ((σ ^ n).weightMap x) := by
        rw [pow_succ', Equiv.mul_eq_comp]
        rfl
      rw [hmul, ih, LinearMap.mem_fixedSubmodule_iff.mp hx]
  rw [indexEquiv_pow_apply σ k i]
  conv_lhs => rw [← hx_fixed k]
  exact ((σ ^ k : P.Aut) : RootPairing.Equiv P P).coroot'_weightEquiv i x

/-- Orthogonality of a root `i` to the rest of its `σ`-orbit implies full symmetric pairwise
orthogonality on `P.orbitIndices σ i`. -/
theorem isOrthogonal_on_orbitIndices {i : ι}
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    (P.orbitIndices σ i : Set ι).Pairwise P.IsOrthogonal := by
  have hpow_mem : ∀ n : ℕ, ∀ w : ι,
      (σ.indexEquiv ^ n) w ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i ↔ w ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i := by
    intro n
    induction n with
    | zero => intro _; rfl
    | succ n ih =>
      intro w
      rw [pow_succ', _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply, indexEquiv_mem_orbitIndices_iff, ih]
  have hpair : ∀ j₁ ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, ∀ j₂ ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, j₁ ≠ j₂ →
      P.pairing j₁ j₂ = 0 := by
    intro j₁ hj₁ j₂ hj₂ hne
    obtain ⟨k, hk⟩ := mem_orbitIndices_iff_exists_pow.mp hj₁
    have hk' : (σ ^ k).indexEquiv i = j₁ := (indexEquiv_pow_apply σ k i).symm.trans hk
    set j₂' := (σ ^ k).indexEquiv.symm j₂
    have hj₂'_mem : j₂' ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i := by
      refine (hpow_mem k j₂').mp ?_
      rw [indexEquiv_pow_apply, _root_.Equiv.apply_symm_apply]
      exact hj₂
    have hij₂' : i ≠ j₂' := fun hEq ↦ hne (by rw [← hk', hEq, _root_.Equiv.apply_symm_apply])
    have hp := Hom.pairing (σ ^ k).toHom (i := i) (j := j₂')
    rw [hk', _root_.Equiv.apply_symm_apply] at hp
    exact hp.trans (horth j₂' hj₂'_mem hij₂')
  exact fun j₁ hj₁ j₂ hj₂ hne ↦ ⟨hpair j₁ hj₁ j₂ hj₂ hne, hpair j₂ hj₂ j₁ hj₁ hne.symm⟩

/-- When the `σ`-orbit of `i` is pairwise orthogonal, `αᵢ^∨` pairs to `2` with `P.orbitSum σ i`. -/
theorem coroot'_orbitSum_self {i : ι}
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    P.coroot' i (P.orbitSum σ i) = 2 := by
  have hp := isOrthogonal_on_orbitIndices horth
  rw [orbitSum_def, map_sum, sum_eq_single i]
  · rw [root_coroot'_eq_pairing, pairing_same]
  · intro j hj hji
    rw [root_coroot'_eq_pairing, (hp hj (P.self_mem_orbitIndices σ i) hji).1]
  · intro hi
    exact absurd (P.self_mem_orbitIndices σ i) hi

variable (P σ)

/-- The **orbit reflection** (block reflection) attached to a root index `i` whose `σ`-orbit is
pairwise orthogonal: the product in `P.weylGroup` of the commuting reflections across
`P.orbitIndices σ i`. -/
noncomputable def orbitReflection (i : ι)
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) : P.weylGroup :=
  P.orthogonalReflectionProd (P.orbitIndices σ i) (isOrthogonal_on_orbitIndices horth)

theorem orbitReflection_def (i : ι)
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    P.orbitReflection σ i horth =
      P.orthogonalReflectionProd (P.orbitIndices σ i) (isOrthogonal_on_orbitIndices horth) := by
  rw [orbitReflection]

variable {P σ}

@[simp]
theorem orbitReflection_mul_self {i : ι}
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    P.orbitReflection σ i horth * P.orbitReflection σ i horth = 1 :=
  P.orthogonalReflectionProd_mul_self _ _

@[simp]
theorem orbitReflection_inv {i : ι}
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    (P.orbitReflection σ i horth)⁻¹ = P.orbitReflection σ i horth :=
  P.orthogonalReflectionProd_inv _ _

theorem orbitReflection_eq_of_mem {i j : ι} (hj : j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i)
    (horth_i : ∀ k ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ k → P.pairing i k = 0)
    (horth_j : ∀ k ∈ P.orbitIndices σ j, j ≠ k → P.pairing j k = 0) :
    P.orbitReflection σ j horth_j = P.orbitReflection σ i horth_i := by
  simp only [orbitReflection]
  exact noncommProd_congr (orbitIndices_eq_of_mem hj) (fun _ _ ↦ rfl) _

/-- On any `σ`-fixed weight `x`, the orbit reflection in `i` acts as the single reflection in the
orbit sum `P.orbitSum σ i` with functional `P.coroot' i`. -/
theorem orbitReflection_smul_of_mem_fixedSubmodule {i : ι}
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) {x : M}
    (hx : x ∈ LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) :
    P.orbitReflection σ i horth • x = x - P.coroot' i x • P.orbitSum σ i := by
  rw [orbitReflection, orthogonalReflectionProd_smul, orbitSum_def, smul_sum]
  congr 1
  refine sum_congr rfl fun j hj ↦ ?_
  rw [coroot'_eq_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_mem_fixedSubmodule hj hx]

/-- Every orbit reflection commutes with `σ` in `P.Aut`. -/
theorem commute_coe_orbitReflection {i : ι}
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    Commute (P.orbitReflection σ i horth : P.Aut) σ := by
  apply Equiv.weightHom_injective P
  ext z
  simp only [map_mul, mul_apply_eq_comp, Equiv.weightHom_apply, Equiv.weightEquiv_apply]
  change (P.orbitReflection σ i horth) • σ.weightMap z =
    σ.weightMap (P.orbitReflection σ i horth • z)
  rw [orbitReflection, orthogonalReflectionProd_smul, orthogonalReflectionProd_smul,
    map_sub, map_sum]
  congr 1
  symm
  refine sum_nbij' σ.indexEquiv σ.indexEquiv.symm
    (fun j hj ↦ indexEquiv_mem_orbitIndices_iff.mpr hj)
    (fun j hj ↦ by
      rw [← indexEquiv_mem_orbitIndices_iff, _root_.Equiv.apply_symm_apply]
      exact hj)
    (fun _ _ ↦ _root_.Equiv.symm_apply_apply _ _)
    (fun _ _ ↦ _root_.Equiv.apply_symm_apply _ _)
    fun j _ ↦ ?_
  rw [map_smul, Hom.root_weightMap_apply]
  congr 1
  exact ((σ : RootPairing.Equiv P P).coroot'_weightEquiv j z).symm

/-- Applying an orbit reflection to any orbit sum produces the orbit sum of the permuted index. -/
theorem orbitReflection_smul_orbitSum {i : ι}
    (horth : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) (k : ι) :
    P.orbitReflection σ i horth • P.orbitSum σ k =
      P.orbitSum σ (P.weylGroupToPerm (P.orbitReflection σ i horth) k) := by
  have hcomm := commute_coe_orbitReflection horth
  have hidx : ∀ j, (P.orbitReflection σ i horth : P.Aut).indexEquiv (σ.indexEquiv j) =
      σ.indexEquiv ((P.orbitReflection σ i horth : P.Aut).indexEquiv j) := fun j ↦ by
    exact congrArg (fun u : P.Aut ↦ u.indexEquiv j) hcomm.eq
  exact P.weightMap_orbitSum (P.orbitReflection σ i horth : P.Aut) hidx k

end OrbitReflection

/-! ### Stembridge descent and the orthogonal simply laced fold -/

section OrthogonalFold

section Helpers

variable {ι R M N : Type*} [Field R] [AddCommGroup M] [Module R M] [AddCommGroup N] [Module R N]
  (P : RootPairing ι R M N) [Finite ι] (b : P.Base) (σ : P.Aut)

/-- Auxiliary subgroup of `P.weylGroup` generated by the simple-orbit reflections. -/
private noncomputable def simpleOrbitClosure
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    Subgroup P.weylGroup :=
  Subgroup.closure {w | ∃ (i : ι) (hi : i ∈ b.support), w = P.orbitReflection σ i (horth i hi)}

private theorem commute_coe_of_mem_simpleOrbitClosure
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    {w : P.weylGroup} (hw : w ∈ simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth) :
    Commute (w : P.Aut) σ := by
  induction hw using Subgroup.closure_induction with
  | mem w hw =>
    obtain ⟨i, hi, rfl⟩ := hw
    exact commute_coe_orbitReflection (horth i hi)
  | one => exact Commute.one_left σ
  | mul _ _ _ _ ih₁ ih₂ => exact ih₁.mul_left ih₂
  | inv _ _ ih => exact ih.inv_left

private theorem weylGroupToPerm_indexEquiv_of_mem_simpleOrbitClosure
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    {w : P.weylGroup} (hw : w ∈ simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth) (j : ι) :
    (w : P.Aut).indexEquiv (σ.indexEquiv j) = σ.indexEquiv ((w : P.Aut).indexEquiv j) :=
  congrArg (fun u : P.Aut ↦ u.indexEquiv j)
    (commute_coe_of_mem_simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth hw).eq

private theorem orbitIndices_subset_support
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support) {i : ι} (hi : i ∈ b.support) :
    (P.orbitIndices σ i : Set ι) ⊆ b.support := by
  intro j hj
  obtain ⟨m, rfl⟩ := mem_orbitIndices_iff_exists_pow.mp hj
  clear hj
  induction m with
  | zero => simpa using hi
  | succ m ih =>
    rw [pow_succ', _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply]
    exact (hbase _).mp ih

/-- The root injection of the folded pairing into `LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap`. -/
private noncomputable def foldedRootEmb :
    P.foldedIndices σ ↪ LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap :=
  ⟨fun γ ↦ ⟨(γ : M), P.coe_foldedIndices_mem_fixedSubmodule σ γ⟩,
    fun _ _ h ↦ Subtype.ext (congrArg (fun x : LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap ↦ (x : M)) h)⟩

@[simp]
private theorem coe_foldedRootEmb (γ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    (foldedRootEmb P σ γ : M) = (γ : M) :=
  rfl

end Helpers

variable {ι R M N : Type*} [Field R] [LinearOrder R] [IsStrictOrderedRing R]
  [AddCommGroup M] [Module R M] [AddCommGroup N] [Module R N]
  (P : RootPairing ι R M N) [Finite ι] [P.IsRootSystem] [P.IsReduced] [P.IsCrystallographic]
  (b : P.Base) (σ : P.Aut)

/-- **Stembridge height descent**: every root index `k` can be mapped into `b.support` by an
element of the subgroup generated by the simple-orbit reflections. -/
private theorem exists_mem_simpleOrbitClosure_mem_support
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k : ι) :
    ∃ w ∈ simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth, P.weylGroupToPerm w k ∈ b.support := by
  have hσ : ∀ j ∈ b.support, σ.indexEquiv j ∈ b.support := fun j hj ↦ (hbase j).mp hj
  have hpos_case : ∀ {k : ι}, b.IsPos k →
      ∃ w ∈ simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth, P.weylGroupToPerm w k ∈ b.support := by
    intro k hk
    obtain ⟨n, hn⟩ := exists_natCast_eq_heightLinearMap_of_mem_posRootCone P b
      (orbitSum_mem_posRootCone hσ hk)
    induction n using Nat.strong_induction_on generalizing k with
    | _ n ih =>
      have hBpos : 0 < (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (P.orbitSum σ k) (P.orbitSum σ k) :=
        b.posDef_simplyLacedForm hsimply (P.orbitSum σ k) (orbitSum_ne_zero hσ k)
      obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := (mem_posRootCone P b).mp (orbitSum_mem_posRootCone hσ hk)
      have hsum_pos : 0 < ∑ i ∈ b.support, c i • P.coroot' i (P.orbitSum σ k) := by
        have hexp : (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (P.orbitSum σ k) (P.orbitSum σ k) =
            ∑ i ∈ b.support, c i • P.coroot' i (P.orbitSum σ k) := by
          conv_lhs =>
            enter [2]
            rw [hc]
          rw [map_sum]
          refine sum_congr rfl fun i _ ↦ ?_
          rw [map_nsmul, b.simplyLacedForm_apply_root_right hsimply]
        rwa [← hexp]
      have hex_pos : ∃ i ∈ b.support, 0 < P.coroot' i (P.orbitSum σ k) := by
        by_contra! hall
        have hle : ∑ i ∈ b.support, c i • P.coroot' i (P.orbitSum σ k) ≤ 0 :=
          sum_nonpos fun i hi ↦ nsmul_nonpos (hall i hi) (c i)
        exact not_lt_of_ge hle hsum_pos
      obtain ⟨i, hi, hi_pos⟩ := hex_pos
      by_cases hmem : k ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i
      · exact ⟨1, Subgroup.one_mem _, orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hi hmem⟩
      · set w_i := P.orbitReflection σ i (horth i hi)
        have hw_i : w_i ∈ simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth := Subgroup.subset_closure ⟨i, hi, rfl⟩
        set k' := P.weylGroupToPerm w_i k
        have hk'_pos : b.IsPos k' := by
          have hk_diff : k ∈ posRoots P b \ P.orbitIndices σ i :=
            ⟨(mem_posRoots P b k).mpr hk, hmem⟩
          have hk'_diff := P.weylGroupToPerm_orthogonalReflectionProd_mem_posRoots_diff b
            (P.orbitIndices σ i) (isOrthogonal_on_orbitIndices (horth i hi))
            (orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hi) hk_diff
          exact (mem_posRoots P b k').mp hk'_diff.1
        obtain ⟨n', hn'⟩ := exists_natCast_eq_heightLinearMap_of_mem_posRootCone P b
          (orbitSum_mem_posRootCone hσ hk'_pos)
        have hht_i : heightLinearMap P b (P.orbitSum σ i) = (#(P.orbitIndices σ i) : R) := by
          rw [orbitSum_def, map_sum]
          have h1 : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, heightLinearMap P b (P.root j) = 1 := fun j hj ↦
            heightLinearMap_simpleRoot P b ⟨j, orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hi hj⟩
          rw [sum_congr rfl h1, sum_const, nsmul_eq_mul, mul_one]
        have horbit_eq : P.orbitSum σ k' =
            P.orbitSum σ k - P.coroot' i (P.orbitSum σ k) • P.orbitSum σ i := by
          rw [← orbitReflection_smul_orbitSum (horth i hi) k,
            orbitReflection_smul_of_mem_fixedSubmodule (horth i hi)
              (P.orbitSum_mem_fixedSubmodule σ k)]
        have hlt_R : (n' : R) < (n : R) := by
          rw [← hn', ← hn, horbit_eq, map_sub, map_smul, hht_i, smul_eq_mul]
          have hcard : (0 : R) < (#(P.orbitIndices σ i) : R) :=
            Nat.cast_pos.mpr (P.card_orbitIndices_pos σ i)
          linarith [mul_pos hi_pos hcard]
        obtain ⟨w', hw', hsupp'⟩ := ih n' (Nat.cast_lt.mp hlt_R) hk'_pos hn'
        refine ⟨w' * w_i, Subgroup.mul_mem _ hw' hw_i, ?_⟩
        simpa [k'] using hsupp'
  by_cases hk : b.IsPos k
  · exact hpos_case hk
  · have hk₀ : b.IsPos (P.reflectionPerm k k) :=
      (isPos_reflectionPerm_self_iff_mem_negRoots P b k).mpr ((mem_negRoots P b k).mpr hk)
    obtain ⟨w, hw, hi⟩ := hpos_case hk₀
    set i := P.weylGroupToPerm w (P.reflectionPerm k k)
    set w_i := P.orbitReflection σ i (horth i hi)
    have hw_i : w_i ∈ simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth := Subgroup.subset_closure ⟨i, hi, rfl⟩
    refine ⟨w_i * w, Subgroup.mul_mem _ hw_i hw, ?_⟩
    suffices P.weylGroupToPerm (w_i * w) k = i from this ▸ hi
    apply P.root.injective
    rw [← P.weylGroup_apply_root, mul_smul, P.weylGroup_apply_root]
    have hneg : P.root (P.weylGroupToPerm w k) = -P.root i := by
      have h := P.weylGroup_apply_root w (P.reflectionPerm k k)
      rw [root_reflectionPerm, reflection_apply_self, smul_neg, P.weylGroup_apply_root] at h
      exact neg_eq_iff_eq_neg.mp h
    rw [hneg, smul_neg, show w_i = P.orbitReflection σ i (horth i hi) from rfl,
      orbitReflection, orthogonalReflectionProd_smul]
    have hsum : ∑ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, P.coroot' j (P.root i) • P.root j =
        (2 : R) • P.root i := by
      rw [sum_eq_single i]
      · rw [root_coroot'_eq_pairing, pairing_same]
      · intro j hj hji
        have hp := isOrthogonal_on_orbitIndices (horth i hi) hj (P.self_mem_orbitIndices σ i) hji
        rw [root_coroot'_eq_pairing, hp.2, zero_smul]
      · exact fun h ↦ absurd (P.self_mem_orbitIndices σ i) h
    rw [hsum]
    module

/-- **Unrestricted orbit orthogonality** (Stembridge, Claim 1): if `σ` permutes a simply laced base
with pairwise orthogonal simple orbits, then **every** `σ`-orbit of roots is pairwise orthogonal. -/
theorem pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k : ι) :
    ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k, k ≠ j → P.pairing k j = 0 := by
  intro j hj hkj
  obtain ⟨w, hw, hi⟩ := exists_mem_simpleOrbitClosure_mem_support P b σ hbase hsimply horth k
  have hmap := P.map_orbitIndices (w : P.Aut)
    (weylGroupToPerm_indexEquiv_of_mem_simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth hw) k
  have hj' : P.weylGroupToPerm w j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ (P.weylGroupToPerm w k) := by
    rw [P.weylGroupToPerm_apply, P.weylGroupToPerm_apply, ← hmap]
    exact mem_map.mpr ⟨j, hj, rfl⟩
  have hne' : P.weylGroupToPerm w k ≠ P.weylGroupToPerm w j :=
    fun h ↦ hkj ((P.weylGroupToPerm w).injective h)
  have hp := Hom.pairing (w : P.Aut).toHom (i := k) (j := j)
  exact hp.symm.trans (horth _ hi _ hj' hne')

/-- Under `b.simplyLacedForm`, any `σ`-fixed weight `x` pairs with `P.orbitSum σ k` to
`#(P.orbitIndices σ k) * P.coroot' k x`. -/
theorem simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_right
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    {x : M} (hx : x ∈ LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) (k : ι) :
    (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form x (P.orbitSum σ k) =
      (#(P.orbitIndices σ k) : R) * P.coroot' k x := by
  rw [orbitSum_def, map_sum]
  have hterm : ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k,
      (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form x (P.root j) = P.coroot' k x := fun j hj ↦ by
    rw [b.simplyLacedForm_apply_root_right hsimply,
      coroot'_eq_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_mem_fixedSubmodule hj hx]
  rw [sum_congr rfl hterm, sum_const, nsmul_eq_mul]

/-- Every orbit sum has squared norm `2 * #(P.orbitIndices σ k)` under `b.simplyLacedForm`. -/
theorem simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_self
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k : ι) :
    (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (P.orbitSum σ k) (P.orbitSum σ k) =
      2 * (#(P.orbitIndices σ k) : R) := by
  rw [simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_right P b σ hsimply (P.orbitSum_mem_fixedSubmodule σ k) k,
    coroot'_orbitSum_self
      (pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced P b σ hbase hsimply horth k),
    mul_comm]

/-- Under `b.simplyLacedForm`, the inner product of two orbit sums equals the total Cartan pairing
between their `σ`-orbits. -/
theorem simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_orbitSum
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced) (k₁ k₂ : ι) :
    (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (P.orbitSum σ k₁) (P.orbitSum σ k₂) =
      ∑ i ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k₁, ∑ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k₂, P.pairing i j := by
  rw [P.orbitSum_def σ k₁, map_sum, LinearMap.sum_apply]
  refine sum_congr rfl fun i _ ↦ ?_
  rw [P.orbitSum_def σ k₂, map_sum]
  refine sum_congr rfl fun j _ ↦ ?_
  rw [b.simplyLacedForm_apply_root_right hsimply, P.root_coroot'_eq_pairing]

/-- Two root indices having the same orbit sum under an orthogonal simply laced fold have orbits of
equal cardinality. -/
theorem card_orbitIndices_eq_of_orbitSum_eq
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    {k₁ k₂ : ι} (hEq : P.orbitSum σ k₁ = P.orbitSum σ k₂) :
    #(P.orbitIndices σ k₁) = #(P.orbitIndices σ k₂) := by
  have h := congrArg (fun v ↦ (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form v v) hEq
  rw [simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_self P b σ hbase hsimply horth k₁,
    simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_self P b σ hbase hsimply horth k₂] at h
  exact Nat.cast_injective (R := R) (mul_left_cancel₀ two_ne_zero h)

/-! ### Construction of `orthogonalOrbitSumRealization` -/

/-- Normalized inner product against `b.simplyLacedForm` defining the coroot functional of a folded
root `γ` on `LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap`. -/
private noncomputable def foldedCorootFun (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (γ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    Module.Dual R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) where
  toFun x := (2 / (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (γ : M) (γ : M)) *
    (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (x : M) (γ : M)
  map_add' x y := by
    simp only [Submodule.coe_add, map_add, LinearMap.add_apply]
    ring
  map_smul' r x := by
    simp only [SetLike.val_smul, map_smul, LinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, RingHom.id_apply]
    ring

private theorem foldedCorootFun_apply_of_orbitSum_eq
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    {γ : P.foldedIndices σ} {k : ι} (hk : P.orbitSum σ k = (γ : M))
    (x : LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) :
    foldedCorootFun P b σ hsimply γ x = P.coroot' k (x : M) := by
  change (2 / (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (γ : M) (γ : M)) *
      (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (x : M) (γ : M) = P.coroot' k (x : M)
  rw [← hk, simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_self P b σ hbase hsimply horth k,
    simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_right P b σ hsimply x.2 k]
  have hcard : (#(P.orbitIndices σ k) : R) ≠ 0 :=
    Nat.cast_ne_zero.mpr (P.card_orbitIndices_pos σ k).ne'
  field_simp

private theorem foldedCorootFun_apply_self
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (γ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    foldedCorootFun P b σ hsimply γ (foldedRootEmb P σ γ) = 2 := by
  obtain ⟨k, rfl⟩ := P.toFoldedIndices_surjective σ γ
  rw [foldedCorootFun_apply_of_orbitSum_eq P b σ hbase hsimply horth
      (P.coe_toFoldedIndices σ k).symm,
    coe_foldedRootEmb, coe_toFoldedIndices]
  exact coroot'_orbitSum_self
    (pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced P b σ hbase hsimply horth k)

private noncomputable def foldedCorootEmb
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    P.foldedIndices σ ↪ Module.Dual R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) :=
  ⟨foldedCorootFun P b σ hsimply, by
    have hσ : ∀ j ∈ b.support, σ.indexEquiv j ∈ b.support := fun j hj ↦ (hbase j).mp hj
    intro γ₁ γ₂ hEq
    set B := b.simplyLacedForm hsimply
    have hpos₁ : 0 < B.form (γ₁ : M) (γ₁ : M) := by
      obtain ⟨k₁, rfl⟩ := P.toFoldedIndices_surjective σ γ₁
      rw [P.coe_toFoldedIndices]
      exact b.posDef_simplyLacedForm hsimply _ (orbitSum_ne_zero hσ k₁)
    set a₁ : R := 2 / B.form (γ₁ : M) (γ₁ : M)
    set a₂ : R := 2 / B.form (γ₂ : M) (γ₂ : M)
    have ha₁ : a₁ ≠ 0 := div_ne_zero two_ne_zero hpos₁.ne'
    set c : R := a₂ / a₁
    have horth_diff : ∀ x : LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap,
        B.form (x : M) ((γ₁ : M) - c • (γ₂ : M)) = 0 := by
      intro x
      have hx := LinearMap.congr_fun hEq x
      change a₁ * B.form (x : M) (γ₁ : M) = a₂ * B.form (x : M) (γ₂ : M) at hx
      rw [map_sub, map_smul, smul_eq_mul]
      have hc : c * B.form (x : M) (γ₂ : M) = B.form (x : M) (γ₁ : M) := by
        rw [div_mul_eq_mul_div, ← hx, mul_div_cancel_left₀ _ ha₁]
      linarith
    set diff : LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap :=
      foldedRootEmb P σ γ₁ - c • foldedRootEmb P σ γ₂
    have hdiff_zero : (diff : M) = 0 := by
      by_contra hne
      have hpd := b.posDef_simplyLacedForm hsimply (diff : M) hne
      rw [LinearMap.BilinMap.toQuadraticMap_apply] at hpd
      have hz := horth_diff diff
      exact hpd.ne' (by simpa [diff] using hz)
    have hγ₁_eq : foldedRootEmb P σ γ₁ = c • foldedRootEmb P σ γ₂ :=
      sub_eq_zero.mp (Subtype.ext hdiff_zero)
    have htwo : (2 : R) = c * 2 := by
      have hval := LinearMap.congr_fun hEq (foldedRootEmb P σ γ₁)
      rw [foldedCorootFun_apply_self P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ₁, hγ₁_eq, map_smul,
        foldedCorootFun_apply_self P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ₂, smul_eq_mul] at hval
      exact hval
    have hc_one : c = 1 := by linarith
    rw [hc_one, one_smul] at hγ₁_eq
    exact (foldedRootEmb P σ).injective hγ₁_eq⟩

omit [LinearOrder R] [IsStrictOrderedRing R] [P.IsReduced] [P.IsCrystallographic] in
/-- For `i, j ∈ b.support`, two simple roots have equal `σ`-orbit sums if and only if they belong
to the same `σ`-orbit. -/
private theorem toFoldedIndices_eq_iff_mem_orbitIndices
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    {i j : ι} (hi : i ∈ b.support) (hj : j ∈ b.support) :
    P.toFoldedIndices σ j = P.toFoldedIndices σ i ↔ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i := by
  classical
  refine ⟨fun hEq ↦ ?_, toFoldedIndices_eq_of_mem⟩
  rw [toFoldedIndices_eq_iff, orbitSum_def, orbitSum_def] at hEq
  have hrepr : ∀ {l : ι}, l ∈ b.support →
      b.toWeightBasis.repr (∑ m ∈ P.orbitIndices σ l, P.root m) ⟨j, hj⟩ =
        if j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ l then 1 else 0 := by
    intro l hl
    rw [map_sum, Finsupp.finsetSum_apply]
    have hterm : ∀ m ∈ P.orbitIndices σ l,
        b.toWeightBasis.repr (P.root m) ⟨j, hj⟩ = if m = j then 1 else 0 := by
      intro m hm
      have hm_supp : m ∈ b.support := orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hl hm
      rw [← b.toWeightBasis_apply ⟨m, hm_supp⟩, Module.Basis.repr_self, Finsupp.single_apply]
      simp [Subtype.ext_iff, eq_comm]
    rw [sum_congr rfl hterm, sum_ite_eq']
  have hval := congrArg (fun v ↦ b.toWeightBasis.repr v ⟨j, hj⟩) hEq
  rw [hrepr hj, hrepr hi] at hval
  simp only [P.self_mem_orbitIndices σ j, ↓reduceIte] at hval
  by_contra hnot
  simp only [hnot, ↓reduceIte] at hval
  exact one_ne_zero hval

omit [LinearOrder R] [IsStrictOrderedRing R] [P.IsReduced] [P.IsCrystallographic] in
/-- Every `σ`-fixed weight lies in the `R`-span of the simple-orbit sums; in particular the folded
roots span `LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap`. -/
private theorem span_foldedRootEmb_eq_top
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support) :
    Submodule.span R (Set.range (foldedRootEmb P σ)) = ⊤ := by
  classical
  rw [eq_top_iff]
  rintro x -
  have hx_fixed : σ.weightMap (x : M) = (x : M) := LinearMap.mem_fixedSubmodule_iff.mp x.2
  have hconst : ∀ {i j : ι} (hi : i ∈ b.support) (hj : j ∈ b.support),
      j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i →
      b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) ⟨j, hj⟩ = b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) ⟨i, hi⟩ := by
    have hstep : ∀ {l : ι} (hl : l ∈ b.support),
        b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) ⟨σ.indexEquiv l, (hbase l).mp hl⟩ =
          b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) ⟨l, hl⟩ := by
      intro l hl
      have hexp : (x : M) = ∑ m : b.support, b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) m • P.root m := by
        simpa [b.toWeightBasis_apply] using (b.toWeightBasis.sum_repr (x : M)).symm
      have hσx : σ.weightMap (x : M) =
          ∑ m : b.support, b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) m • P.root (σ.indexEquiv m) := by
        conv_lhs => rw [hexp]
        rw [map_sum]
        exact sum_congr rfl fun m _ ↦ by rw [map_smul, Hom.root_weightMap_apply]
      rw [hx_fixed] at hσx
      have hrepr := congrArg (fun v ↦ b.toWeightBasis.repr v ⟨σ.indexEquiv l, (hbase l).mp hl⟩) hσx
      rw [map_sum, Finsupp.finsetSum_apply] at hrepr
      have hterm : ∀ m : b.support,
          b.toWeightBasis.repr (b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) m • P.root (σ.indexEquiv m))
            ⟨σ.indexEquiv l, (hbase l).mp hl⟩ =
            if m = ⟨l, hl⟩ then b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) ⟨l, hl⟩ else 0 := by
        intro m
        have hm' : σ.indexEquiv m.1 ∈ b.support := (hbase m.1).mp m.2
        rw [map_smul, ← b.toWeightBasis_apply ⟨σ.indexEquiv m.1, hm'⟩, Module.Basis.repr_self,
          Finsupp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, Finsupp.single_apply]
        by_cases hml : m = ⟨l, hl⟩
        · subst hml
          simp
        · have hne : (⟨σ.indexEquiv m.1, hm'⟩ : b.support) ≠ ⟨σ.indexEquiv l, (hbase l).mp hl⟩ := by
            intro h
            apply hml
            ext
            exact σ.indexEquiv.injective (congrArg Subtype.val h)
          simp only [hne, ↓reduceIte, hml, mul_zero]
      rw [sum_congr rfl fun m _ ↦ hterm m, sum_ite_eq'] at hrepr
      simpa only [mem_univ, ↓reduceIte] using hrepr
    intro i j hi hj hj_mem
    obtain ⟨m, rfl⟩ := mem_orbitIndices_iff_exists_pow.mp hj_mem
    clear hj_mem
    induction m with
    | zero => rfl
    | succ m ih =>
      have hm_supp : (σ.indexEquiv ^ m) i ∈ b.support :=
        orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hi (mem_orbitIndices_iff_exists_pow.mpr ⟨m, rfl⟩)
      have h1 := hstep hm_supp
      simp only [pow_succ', _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply] at hj ⊢
      exact h1.trans (ih hm_supp)
  set s : Finset (P.foldedIndices σ) := b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ)
  let c₀ (j : ι) : R :=
    if hj : j ∈ b.support then b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) ⟨j, hj⟩ else 0
  have hx_eq : x =
      ∑ γ ∈ s.attach, c₀ (mem_image.mp γ.2).choose • foldedRootEmb P σ γ.1 := by
    apply Subtype.ext
    rw [Submodule.coe_sum]
    simp only [SetLike.val_smul, coe_foldedRootEmb]
    have hfiber :
        ∑ γ ∈ s.attach, c₀ (mem_image.mp γ.2).choose • (γ.1 : M) =
          ∑ j ∈ b.support, c₀ j • P.root j := by
      have hsplit : ∑ j ∈ b.support, c₀ j • P.root j =
          ∑ γ ∈ s, ∑ j ∈ b.support with P.toFoldedIndices σ j = γ, c₀ j • P.root j :=
        (sum_fiberwise_of_maps_to (fun j hj ↦ mem_image_of_mem _ hj) _).symm
      rw [hsplit, ← sum_attach s]
      refine sum_congr rfl fun γ _ ↦ ?_
      set i₀ := (mem_image.mp γ.2).choose
      have hi₀ : i₀ ∈ b.support := (mem_image.mp γ.2).choose_spec.1
      have hγ_eq : P.toFoldedIndices σ i₀ = γ.1 := (mem_image.mp γ.2).choose_spec.2
      have hfilt : ({j ∈ b.support | P.toFoldedIndices σ j = γ.1} : Finset ι) =
          P.orbitIndices σ i₀ := by
        ext j
        simp only [mem_filter, ← hγ_eq]
        exact ⟨fun ⟨hj_s, hEq⟩ ↦
            (toFoldedIndices_eq_iff_mem_orbitIndices P b σ hbase hi₀ hj_s).mp hEq,
          fun hj_m ↦ ⟨orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hi₀ hj_m,
            toFoldedIndices_eq_of_mem hj_m⟩⟩
      rw [hfilt, ← hγ_eq, coe_toFoldedIndices, orbitSum_def, smul_sum]
      refine sum_congr rfl fun j hj ↦ ?_
      have hj_supp : j ∈ b.support := orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hi₀ hj
      have hc₀_i₀ : c₀ i₀ = b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) ⟨i₀, hi₀⟩ := by
        simp only [c₀, hi₀, ↓reduceDIte]
      have hc₀_j : c₀ j = b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) ⟨j, hj_supp⟩ := by
        simp only [c₀, hj_supp, ↓reduceDIte]
      rw [hc₀_i₀, hc₀_j, hconst hi₀ hj_supp hj]
    rw [hfiber]
    have hbasis := (b.toWeightBasis.sum_repr (x : M)).symm
    rw [hbasis, ← sum_attach b.support]
    refine sum_congr rfl fun j _ ↦ ?_
    have hcj : c₀ j.1 = b.toWeightBasis.repr (x : M) j := by
      simp only [c₀, j.2, ↓reduceDIte]
    rw [hcj, b.toWeightBasis_apply]
  rw [hx_eq]
  exact Submodule.sum_mem _ fun γ _ ↦
    Submodule.smul_mem _ _ (Submodule.subset_span (Set.mem_range_self γ.1))

private theorem mapsTo_preReflection_foldedRootEmb
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (γ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    Set.MapsTo
      (Module.preReflection (foldedRootEmb P σ γ)
        ((Module.Dual.eval R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap)).flip
          (foldedCorootEmb P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ)))
      (Set.range (foldedRootEmb P σ)) (Set.range (foldedRootEmb P σ)) := by
  rintro _ ⟨γ', rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨i, rfl⟩ := P.toFoldedIndices_surjective σ γ
  obtain ⟨k, rfl⟩ := P.toFoldedIndices_surjective σ γ'
  have horth_i := pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced P b σ hbase hsimply horth i
  refine ⟨P.toFoldedIndices σ (P.weylGroupToPerm (P.orbitReflection σ i horth_i) k), ?_⟩
  apply Subtype.ext
  rw [Module.preReflection_apply, Submodule.coe_sub, SetLike.val_smul,
    coe_foldedRootEmb, coe_foldedRootEmb, coe_foldedRootEmb,
    coe_toFoldedIndices, coe_toFoldedIndices, coe_toFoldedIndices]
  change P.orbitSum σ (P.weylGroupToPerm (P.orbitReflection σ i horth_i) k) =
    P.orbitSum σ k -
      foldedCorootFun P b σ hsimply (P.toFoldedIndices σ i)
        (foldedRootEmb P σ (P.toFoldedIndices σ k)) • P.orbitSum σ i
  rw [foldedCorootFun_apply_of_orbitSum_eq P b σ hbase hsimply horth
      (P.coe_toFoldedIndices σ i).symm,
    coe_foldedRootEmb, coe_toFoldedIndices,
    ← orbitReflection_smul_of_mem_fixedSubmodule horth_i (P.orbitSum_mem_fixedSubmodule σ k),
    orbitReflection_smul_orbitSum horth_i k]

omit [LinearOrder R] [IsStrictOrderedRing R] [P.IsReduced] [P.IsCrystallographic] in
private theorem finite_fixedSubmodule
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support) :
    Module.Finite R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) := by
  classical
  refine ⟨⟨(Set.finite_range (foldedRootEmb P σ)).toFinset, ?_⟩⟩
  rw [Set.Finite.coe_toFinset]
  exact span_foldedRootEmb_eq_top P b σ hbase

/-- Auxiliary folded root pairing constructed via `RootPairing.mk''`. -/
private noncomputable def foldedPairing
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    RootPairing (P.foldedIndices σ) R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap)
      (Module.Dual R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap)) :=
  haveI := finite_fixedSubmodule P b σ hbase
  RootPairing.mk'' (Module.Dual.eval R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap))
    (foldedRootEmb P σ)
    (foldedCorootEmb P b σ hbase hsimply horth)
    (foldedCorootFun_apply_self P b σ hbase hsimply horth)
    (mapsTo_preReflection_foldedRootEmb P b σ hbase hsimply horth)
    (span_foldedRootEmb_eq_top P b σ hbase)

private theorem foldedPairing_toLinearMap
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (x : LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap)
    (y : Module.Dual R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap)) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).toLinearMap x y = y x :=
  rfl

private theorem foldedPairing_root
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (γ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).root γ = foldedRootEmb P σ γ :=
  rfl

private theorem foldedPairing_coroot
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (γ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).coroot γ =
      foldedCorootEmb P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ :=
  rfl

private theorem foldedPairing_pairing_toFoldedIndices
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k₁ k₂ : ι) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).pairing
      (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₁) (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₂) =
      ∑ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k₁, P.pairing j k₂ := by
  change foldedCorootFun P b σ hsimply (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₂)
    (foldedRootEmb P σ (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₁)) = _
  rw [foldedCorootFun_apply_of_orbitSum_eq P b σ hbase hsimply horth
      (P.coe_toFoldedIndices σ k₂).symm,
    coe_foldedRootEmb, coe_toFoldedIndices, orbitSum_def, map_sum]
  exact sum_congr rfl fun j _ ↦ P.root_coroot'_eq_pairing k₂ j

private theorem foldedPairing_exists_int_pairing
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (γ₁ γ₂ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    ∃ z : ℤ, (z : R) =
      (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).toLinearMap
        ((foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).root γ₁)
        ((foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).coroot γ₂) := by
  obtain ⟨k₁, rfl⟩ := P.toFoldedIndices_surjective σ γ₁
  obtain ⟨k₂, rfl⟩ := P.toFoldedIndices_surjective σ γ₂
  refine ⟨∑ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k₁, P.pairingIn ℤ j k₂, ?_⟩
  rw [root_coroot_eq_pairing, foldedPairing_pairing_toFoldedIndices, Int.cast_sum]
  exact sum_congr rfl fun j _ ↦ by simpa using P.algebraMap_pairingIn ℤ j k₂

private theorem isCrystallographic_foldedPairing
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).IsCrystallographic where
  exists_value γ₁ γ₂ := by
    obtain ⟨z, hz⟩ := foldedPairing_exists_int_pairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ₁ γ₂
    exact ⟨z, by simpa using hz⟩

private theorem isRootSystem_foldedPairing
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).IsRootSystem := by
  have := finite_fixedSubmodule P b σ hbase
  exact RootPairing.isRootSystem_mk'' (foldedPairing_exists_int_pairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth)

private theorem foldedPairing_reflectionPerm_toFoldedIndices
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (i k : ι) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).reflectionPerm
      (P.toFoldedIndices σ i) (P.toFoldedIndices σ k) =
      P.toFoldedIndices σ (P.weylGroupToPerm
        (P.orbitReflection σ i
          (pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced P b σ hbase hsimply horth i))
        k) := by
  set Q := foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  set horth_i := pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced P b σ hbase hsimply horth i
  apply Q.root.injective
  apply Subtype.ext
  have hlhs := congrArg Subtype.val (Q.root_reflectionPerm (P.toFoldedIndices σ i)
    (P.toFoldedIndices σ k))
  rw [hlhs, Q.reflection_apply, Submodule.coe_sub, SetLike.val_smul, Q.root_coroot'_eq_pairing,
    ← Q.root_coroot_eq_pairing, foldedPairing_toLinearMap,
    foldedPairing_root, foldedPairing_root, foldedPairing_root,
    foldedPairing_coroot, coe_foldedRootEmb, coe_foldedRootEmb, coe_foldedRootEmb,
    coe_toFoldedIndices, coe_toFoldedIndices, coe_toFoldedIndices]
  change P.orbitSum σ k -
      foldedCorootFun P b σ hsimply (P.toFoldedIndices σ i)
        (foldedRootEmb P σ (P.toFoldedIndices σ k)) • P.orbitSum σ i =
    P.orbitSum σ (P.weylGroupToPerm (P.orbitReflection σ i horth_i) k)
  rw [foldedCorootFun_apply_of_orbitSum_eq P b σ hbase hsimply horth
      (P.coe_toFoldedIndices σ i).symm,
    coe_foldedRootEmb, coe_toFoldedIndices,
    ← orbitReflection_smul_of_mem_fixedSubmodule horth_i (P.orbitSum_mem_fixedSubmodule σ k),
    orbitReflection_smul_orbitSum horth_i k]

/-- Auxiliary homomorphism mapping simple-orbit reflections of `P` into the subgroup of
`foldedPairing.weylGroup` generated by the simple-orbit folded indices, tracking the root-index
action along `P.toFoldedIndices σ`. -/
private theorem exists_mem_closure_foldedPairing_eq_toFoldedIndices
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    [DecidableEq (P.foldedIndices σ)] {w : P.weylGroup}
    (hw : w ∈ simpleOrbitClosure P b σ horth) :
    ∃ u ∈ Subgroup.closure
        (weylGroup.ofIdx (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth) ''
          (b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ) : Set (P.foldedIndices σ))),
      ∀ k : ι,
        (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).weylGroupToPerm u (P.toFoldedIndices σ k) =
          P.toFoldedIndices σ (P.weylGroupToPerm w k) := by
  set Q := foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  set s := b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ)
  induction hw using Subgroup.closure_induction with
  | mem w hw =>
    obtain ⟨i, hi, rfl⟩ := hw
    refine ⟨weylGroup.ofIdx Q (P.toFoldedIndices σ i),
      Subgroup.subset_closure ⟨P.toFoldedIndices σ i, mem_image_of_mem _ hi, rfl⟩, fun k ↦ ?_⟩
    rw [Q.weylGroupToPerm_ofIdx_apply,
      foldedPairing_reflectionPerm_toFoldedIndices P b σ hbase hsimply horth i k]
  | one =>
    exact ⟨1, Subgroup.one_mem _, fun _ ↦ by simp⟩
  | mul w₁ w₂ _ _ ih₁ ih₂ =>
    obtain ⟨u₁, hu₁, hperm₁⟩ := ih₁
    obtain ⟨u₂, hu₂, hperm₂⟩ := ih₂
    refine ⟨u₁ * u₂, Subgroup.mul_mem _ hu₁ hu₂, fun k ↦ ?_⟩
    rw [map_mul, _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply, hperm₂ k, hperm₁ (P.weylGroupToPerm w₂ k),
      ← _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply, ← map_mul]
  | inv w _ ih =>
    obtain ⟨u, hu, hperm⟩ := ih
    refine ⟨u⁻¹, Subgroup.inv_mem _ hu, fun k ↦ ?_⟩
    apply (Q.weylGroupToPerm u).injective
    have h1 : Q.weylGroupToPerm u (Q.weylGroupToPerm u⁻¹ (P.toFoldedIndices σ k)) =
        P.toFoldedIndices σ k := by
      rw [← _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply, ← map_mul, mul_inv_cancel, map_one,
        _root_.Equiv.Perm.one_apply]
    have h2 : Q.weylGroupToPerm u (P.toFoldedIndices σ (P.weylGroupToPerm w⁻¹ k)) =
        P.toFoldedIndices σ k := by
      rw [hperm (P.weylGroupToPerm w⁻¹ k), ← _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply, ← map_mul,
        mul_inv_cancel, map_one, _root_.Equiv.Perm.one_apply]
    exact h1.trans h2.symm

/-- Every folded root and coroot lies in the `ℤ`-span of the simple-orbit folded roots and
coroots, and every folded root index is Weyl-conjugate to a simple-orbit folded index. -/
private theorem exists_weylGroup_and_mem_span_int_foldedPairing
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    [DecidableEq (P.foldedIndices σ)] (γ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    (∃ u : (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).weylGroup,
      (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).weylGroupToPerm u γ ∈
        b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ)) ∧
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).root γ ∈
      Submodule.span ℤ
        ((foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).root ''
          (b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ))) ∧
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).coroot γ ∈
      Submodule.span ℤ
        ((foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).coroot ''
          (b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ))) := by
  have := isCrystallographic_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  set Q := foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  set s := b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ)
  obtain ⟨k, rfl⟩ := P.toFoldedIndices_surjective σ γ
  obtain ⟨w, hw, hk_supp⟩ := exists_mem_simpleOrbitClosure_mem_support P b σ hbase hsimply horth k
  obtain ⟨u, hu, hperm⟩ :=
    exists_mem_closure_foldedPairing_eq_toFoldedIndices P b σ hbase hsimply horth hw
  have hmem_s : Q.weylGroupToPerm u (P.toFoldedIndices σ k) ∈ s := by
    rw [hperm k]
    exact mem_image_of_mem _ hk_supp
  have hinv_span : ∀ {v : Q.weylGroup},
      v ∈ Subgroup.closure (weylGroup.ofIdx Q '' (s : Set (P.foldedIndices σ))) →
      ∀ δ : P.foldedIndices σ,
        Q.root δ ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.root '' s) ∧
        Q.coroot δ ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.coroot '' s) →
        Q.root (Q.weylGroupToPerm v δ) ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.root '' s) ∧
        Q.coroot (Q.weylGroupToPerm v δ) ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.coroot '' s) := by
    have hstep : ∀ {γ₀ : P.foldedIndices σ}, γ₀ ∈ s → ∀ δ : P.foldedIndices σ,
        Q.root δ ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.root '' s) ∧
        Q.coroot δ ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.coroot '' s) →
        Q.root (Q.reflectionPerm γ₀ δ) ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.root '' s) ∧
        Q.coroot (Q.reflectionPerm γ₀ δ) ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.coroot '' s) := by
      intro γ₀ hγ₀ δ ⟨hroot_δ, hcoroot_δ⟩
      refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
      · have hr := (Q.reflectionPerm_root γ₀ δ).symm
        rw [Q.root_coroot_eq_pairing, ← Q.algebraMap_pairingIn ℤ δ γ₀, algebraMap_smul] at hr
        rw [hr]
        exact Submodule.sub_mem _ hroot_δ
          (Submodule.smul_mem _ _ (Submodule.subset_span ⟨_, hγ₀, rfl⟩))
      · have hc := (Q.reflectionPerm_coroot γ₀ δ).symm
        rw [Q.root_coroot_eq_pairing, ← Q.algebraMap_pairingIn ℤ γ₀ δ, algebraMap_smul] at hc
        rw [hc]
        exact Submodule.sub_mem _ hcoroot_δ
          (Submodule.smul_mem _ _ (Submodule.subset_span ⟨_, hγ₀, rfl⟩))
    intro v hv
    induction hv using Subgroup.closure_induction'' with
    | mem v hv =>
      obtain ⟨γ₀, hγ₀, rfl⟩ := hv
      intro δ hδ
      rw [Q.weylGroupToPerm_ofIdx_apply]
      exact hstep hγ₀ δ hδ
    | inv_mem v hv =>
      obtain ⟨γ₀, hγ₀, rfl⟩ := hv
      intro δ hδ
      rw [weylGroup.ofIdx_inv_eq Q γ₀, Q.weylGroupToPerm_ofIdx_apply]
      exact hstep hγ₀ δ hδ
    | one =>
      intro δ hδ
      simpa using hδ
    | mul _ _ _ _ ih₁ ih₂ =>
      intro δ hδ
      rw [map_mul, _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply]
      exact ih₁ _ (ih₂ δ hδ)
  have hbase_span :
      Q.root (Q.weylGroupToPerm u (P.toFoldedIndices σ k)) ∈ Submodule.span ℤ (Q.root '' s) ∧
      Q.coroot (Q.weylGroupToPerm u (P.toFoldedIndices σ k)) ∈
        Submodule.span ℤ (Q.coroot '' s) :=
    ⟨Submodule.subset_span ⟨_, hmem_s, rfl⟩, Submodule.subset_span ⟨_, hmem_s, rfl⟩⟩
  have hback := hinv_span (Subgroup.inv_mem _ hu) _ hbase_span
  have hu_cancel :
      Q.weylGroupToPerm u⁻¹ (Q.weylGroupToPerm u (P.toFoldedIndices σ k)) =
        P.toFoldedIndices σ k := by
    rw [← _root_.Equiv.Perm.mul_apply, ← map_mul, inv_mul_cancel, map_one,
      _root_.Equiv.Perm.one_apply]
  rw [hu_cancel] at hback
  exact ⟨⟨u, hmem_s⟩, hback⟩

private theorem linearIndepOn_foldedPairing_root
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    [DecidableEq (P.foldedIndices σ)] :
    LinearIndepOn R (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).root
      (b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ)) := by
  classical
  set Q := foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  set s := b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ)
  rw [linearIndepOn_iff']
  intro t c hts hsum γ₀ hγ₀_t
  obtain ⟨i₀, hi₀, hi₀_eq⟩ := mem_image.mp (hts hγ₀_t)
  have hsum_coe : ∑ γ ∈ t, c γ • (Q.root γ : M) = 0 := by
    simpa [Submodule.coe_sum] using congrArg Subtype.val hsum
  have hcoord := congrArg (fun v ↦ b.toWeightBasis.repr v ⟨i₀, hi₀⟩) hsum_coe
  rw [map_zero, map_sum, Finsupp.finsetSum_apply, Finsupp.zero_apply] at hcoord
  have hterm : ∀ γ ∈ t,
      b.toWeightBasis.repr (c γ • (Q.root γ : M)) ⟨i₀, hi₀⟩ =
        if γ = γ₀ then c γ else 0 := by
    intro γ hγ_t
    obtain ⟨j, hj, rfl⟩ := mem_image.mp (hts hγ_t)
    rw [map_smul, Finsupp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, foldedPairing_root, coe_foldedRootEmb,
      coe_toFoldedIndices, orbitSum_def, map_sum, Finsupp.finsetSum_apply]
    have hinner : ∀ m ∈ P.orbitIndices σ j,
        b.toWeightBasis.repr (P.root m) ⟨i₀, hi₀⟩ = if m = i₀ then 1 else 0 := by
      intro m hm
      have hm_supp : m ∈ b.support := orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hj hm
      rw [← b.toWeightBasis_apply ⟨m, hm_supp⟩, Module.Basis.repr_self, Finsupp.single_apply]
      simp [Subtype.ext_iff, eq_comm]
    rw [sum_congr rfl hinner, sum_ite_eq']
    by_cases hEq : P.toFoldedIndices σ j = γ₀
    · have hi₀_mem : i₀ ∈ P.orbitIndices σ j :=
        (toFoldedIndices_eq_iff_mem_orbitIndices P b σ hbase hj hi₀).mp (hi₀_eq.trans hEq.symm)
      simp only [hi₀_mem, hEq, ↓reduceIte, mul_one]
    · have hi₀_notMem : i₀ ∉ P.orbitIndices σ j := fun hm ↦
        hEq (hi₀_eq ▸ (toFoldedIndices_eq_of_mem hm).symm)
      simp only [hi₀_notMem, hEq, ↓reduceIte, mul_zero]
  rw [sum_congr rfl hterm, sum_ite_eq'] at hcoord
  simpa only [hγ₀_t, ↓reduceIte] using hcoord

private theorem pairwise_pairingIn_le_zero_foldedPairing
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    [DecidableEq (P.foldedIndices σ)] :
    haveI := isCrystallographic_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
    Set.Pairwise (b.support.image (P.toFoldedIndices σ) : Set (P.foldedIndices σ))
      fun γ₁ γ₂ ↦ (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).pairingIn ℤ γ₁ γ₂ ≤ 0 := by
  let := isCrystallographic_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  set Q := foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  intro γ₁ hγ₁ γ₂ hγ₂ hne
  obtain ⟨i₁, hi₁, rfl⟩ := mem_image.mp hγ₁
  obtain ⟨i₂, hi₂, rfl⟩ := mem_image.mp hγ₂
  have hp_eq : Q.pairingIn ℤ (P.toFoldedIndices σ i₁) (P.toFoldedIndices σ i₂) =
      ∑ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i₁, P.pairingIn ℤ j i₂ := by
    apply FaithfulSMul.algebraMap_injective ℤ R
    rw [Q.algebraMap_pairingIn ℤ, foldedPairing_pairing_toFoldedIndices, map_sum]
    exact sum_congr rfl fun j _ ↦ (P.algebraMap_pairingIn ℤ j i₂).symm
  rw [hp_eq]
  refine sum_nonpos fun j hj ↦ ?_
  have hj_supp : j ∈ b.support := orbitIndices_subset_support P b σ hbase hi₁ hj
  have hji₂ : j ≠ i₂ := fun hEq ↦ hne <| by
    rw [← hEq]
    exact (toFoldedIndices_eq_of_mem hj).symm
  exact b.pairingIn_le_zero_of_ne hji₂ hj_supp hi₂

/-- Auxiliary base of `foldedPairing` constructed via `Base.mkOfPairwiseLEZero`. -/
private noncomputable def foldedBase
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).Base := by
  classical
  letI := isCrystallographic_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  exact Base.mkOfPairwiseLEZero (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth)
    (linearIndepOn_foldedPairing_root P b σ hbase hsimply horth)
    (pairwise_pairingIn_le_zero_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth)
    (fun γ ↦ (exists_weylGroup_and_mem_span_int_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ).2.2)
    (fun γ ↦ (exists_weylGroup_and_mem_span_int_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ).2.1)

private theorem mem_foldedBase_support_iff
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (γ : P.foldedIndices σ) :
    γ ∈ (foldedBase P b σ hbase hsimply horth).support ↔
      ∃ j ∈ b.support, P.orbitSum σ j = (γ : M) := by
  classical
  let := isCrystallographic_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  simp only [foldedBase, Base.mkOfPairwiseLEZero_support, mem_image]
  exact ⟨fun ⟨j, hj, hEq⟩ ↦
      ⟨j, hj, (P.coe_toFoldedIndices σ j).symm.trans (congrArg Subtype.val hEq)⟩,
    fun ⟨j, hj, hEq⟩ ↦
      ⟨j, hj, Subtype.ext ((P.coe_toFoldedIndices σ j).trans hEq)⟩⟩

private theorem isReduced_foldedPairing
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    (foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth).IsReduced where
  eq_or_eq_neg γ₁ γ₂ hdep := by
    classical
    set Q := foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
    let := isCrystallographic_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
    set bQ : Q.Base := Base.mkOfPairwiseLEZero Q
      (linearIndepOn_foldedPairing_root P b σ hbase hsimply horth)
      (pairwise_pairingIn_le_zero_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth)
      (fun γ ↦ (exists_weylGroup_and_mem_span_int_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ).2.2)
      (fun γ ↦ (exists_weylGroup_and_mem_span_int_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ).2.1)
    rw [LinearIndependent.pair_iff' (Q.ne_zero γ₁)] at hdep
    push Not at hdep
    obtain ⟨t, ht⟩ := hdep
    obtain ⟨u, hu_mem⟩ :=
      (exists_weylGroup_and_mem_span_int_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth γ₁).1
    have hu_supp : Q.weylGroupToPerm u γ₁ ∈ bQ.support := by
      simpa [bQ] using hu_mem
    have ht_mem : t • Q.root (Q.weylGroupToPerm u γ₁) ∈ Set.range Q.root := by
      refine ⟨Q.weylGroupToPerm u γ₂, ?_⟩
      rw [← Q.weylGroup_apply_root, ← Q.weylGroup_apply_root, ← ht, smul_comm]
    have : Module.IsReflexive R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) :=
      .of_isPerfPair Q.toLinearMap
    have : Module.IsReflexive R (Module.Dual R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap)) :=
      .of_isPerfPair Q.flip.toLinearMap
    have : HasUniqueDiv (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) := .of_isTorsionFree R _
    have : HasUniqueDiv (Module.Dual R (LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap)) :=
      .of_isTorsionFree R _
    rcases bQ.eq_one_or_neg_one_of_mem_support_of_smul_mem _ hu_supp t ht_mem with rfl | rfl
    · left
      simpa using ht
    · right
      rw [neg_smul, one_smul] at ht
      exact neg_eq_iff_eq_neg.mp ht

/-- **The orthogonal orbit-sum fold** (Stembridge, Claim 1): for a simply laced root system `P`
over a linearly ordered field and a base-preserving automorphism `σ` whose simple-root orbits are
pairwise orthogonal, the distinct orbit sums realize a reduced crystallographic root system on
`LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap` and its linear dual, with base given by the simple-orbit
sums. -/
noncomputable def orthogonalOrbitSumRealization
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    P.OrbitSumRealization b σ where
  pairing := foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  base := foldedBase P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  rootSystem := isRootSystem_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  reduced := isReduced_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  crystallographic := isCrystallographic_foldedPairing P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  evaluation := foldedPairing_toLinearMap P b σ hbase hsimply horth
  root_eq _ := rfl
  base_eq := mem_foldedBase_support_iff P b σ hbase hsimply horth

/-- Existence form of `RootPairing.orthogonalOrbitSumRealization`. -/
theorem nonempty_orbitSumRealization_of_isSimplyLaced
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0) :
    Nonempty (P.OrbitSumRealization b σ) :=
  ⟨P.orthogonalOrbitSumRealization b σ hbase hsimply horth⟩

/-! ### Coroot, Cartan-pairing, and reflection formulas for any `OrbitSumRealization` -/

namespace OrbitSumRealization

variable {P b σ}

/-- In an orthogonal simply laced fold, the folded coroot of `P.toFoldedIndices σ k` restricts
`P.coroot' k` to the fixed weight space. -/
theorem coroot_toFoldedIndices_apply (F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k : ι) (x : LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) :
    F.pairing.coroot (P.toFoldedIndices σ k) x = P.coroot' k (x : M) := by
  obtain rfl : F = P.orthogonalOrbitSumRealization b σ hbase hsimply horth :=
    Subsingleton.elim _ _
  exact foldedCorootFun_apply_of_orbitSum_eq P b σ hbase hsimply horth
    (P.coe_toFoldedIndices σ k).symm x

/-- If `P.orbitSum σ k = (γ : M)`, then `F.pairing.coroot γ` agrees with `P.coroot' k` on the
fixed weight space. -/
theorem coroot_apply_of_orbitSum_eq (F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    {γ : P.foldedIndices σ} {k : ι} (hk : P.orbitSum σ k = (γ : M))
    (x : LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) :
    F.pairing.coroot γ x = P.coroot' k (x : M) := by
  have hEq : P.toFoldedIndices σ k = γ := Subtype.ext ((P.coe_toFoldedIndices σ k).trans hk)
  rw [← hEq, F.coroot_toFoldedIndices_apply hbase hsimply horth k x]

/-- Formula for the Cartan pairing of two folded roots in terms of the ambient pairing summed over
the first orbit. -/
theorem pairing_toFoldedIndices (F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k₁ k₂ : ι) :
    F.pairing.pairing (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₁) (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₂) =
      ∑ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k₁, P.pairing j k₂ := by
  obtain rfl : F = P.orthogonalOrbitSumRealization b σ hbase hsimply horth :=
    Subsingleton.elim _ _
  exact foldedPairing_pairing_toFoldedIndices P b σ hbase hsimply horth k₁ k₂

/-- Integer Cartan pairing formula for two folded roots:
`⟨∑_{j ∈ O₁} αⱼ, β^∨⟩ = ∑_{j ∈ O₁} ⟨αⱼ, α_{k₂}^∨⟩`. -/
theorem pairingIn_toFoldedIndices (F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k₁ k₂ : ι) :
    F.pairing.pairingIn ℤ (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₁) (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₂) =
      ∑ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k₁, P.pairingIn ℤ j k₂ := by
  apply FaithfulSMul.algebraMap_injective ℤ R
  rw [F.pairing.algebraMap_pairingIn ℤ, F.pairing_toFoldedIndices hbase hsimply horth, map_sum]
  exact sum_congr rfl fun j _ ↦ (P.algebraMap_pairingIn ℤ j k₂).symm

/-- Under `b.simplyLacedForm`, the inner product of two orbit sums equals the second orbit size
times their folded Cartan pairing. -/
theorem simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_eq_card_mul_pairing (F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k₁ k₂ : ι) :
    (b.simplyLacedForm hsimply).form (P.orbitSum σ k₁) (P.orbitSum σ k₂) =
      (#(P.orbitIndices σ k₂) : R) *
        F.pairing.pairing (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₁) (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₂) := by
  rw [simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_right P b σ hsimply (P.orbitSum_mem_fixedSubmodule σ k₁) k₂,
    F.pairing_toFoldedIndices hbase hsimply horth, orbitSum_def, map_sum]
  congr 1

/-- Symmetric orbit-sum Cartan pairing formula: the folded pairing of `P.toFoldedIndices σ k₁` and
`P.toFoldedIndices σ k₂` is the total ambient pairing between the two orbits divided by the second
orbit's size. -/
theorem pairing_toFoldedIndices_eq_div_card (F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k₁ k₂ : ι) :
    F.pairing.pairing (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₁) (P.toFoldedIndices σ k₂) =
      (∑ i ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k₁, ∑ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ k₂, P.pairing i j) /
        (#(P.orbitIndices σ k₂) : R) := by
  have hcard : (#(P.orbitIndices σ k₂) : R) ≠ 0 :=
    Nat.cast_ne_zero.mpr (P.card_orbitIndices_pos σ k₂).ne'
  rw [← simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_orbitSum P b σ hsimply,
    F.simplyLacedForm_orbitSum_eq_card_mul_pairing hbase hsimply horth,
    mul_div_cancel_left₀ _ hcard]

/-- Every folded root reflection acts on `LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap` as the ambient
orbit reflection `P.orbitReflection σ k`. -/
theorem coe_reflection_toFoldedIndices_apply (F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (k : ι) (x : LinearMap.fixedSubmodule σ.weightMap) :
    (F.pairing.reflection (P.toFoldedIndices σ k) x : M) =
      P.orbitReflection σ k
        (P.pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced b σ hbase hsimply horth k) •
        (x : M) := by
  rw [reflection_apply, Submodule.coe_sub, Submodule.coe_smul_of_tower, F.coroot'_apply,
    F.coroot_toFoldedIndices_apply hbase hsimply horth k x, F.coe_root, coe_toFoldedIndices,
    orbitReflection_smul_of_mem_fixedSubmodule _ x.2]

/-- The reflection permutation in the folded pairing mirrors the permutation action of
`P.orbitReflection σ i` on root indices. -/
theorem reflectionPerm_toFoldedIndices (F : P.OrbitSumRealization b σ)
    (hbase : ∀ i : ι, i ∈ b.support ↔ σ.indexEquiv i ∈ b.support)
    (hsimply : b.cartanMatrix.IsSimplyLaced)
    (horth : ∀ i ∈ b.support, ∀ j ∈ P.orbitIndices σ i, i ≠ j → P.pairing i j = 0)
    (i k : ι) :
    F.pairing.reflectionPerm (P.toFoldedIndices σ i) (P.toFoldedIndices σ k) =
      P.toFoldedIndices σ (P.weylGroupToPerm
        (P.orbitReflection σ i
          (P.pairing_eq_zero_of_mem_orbitIndices_of_isSimplyLaced b σ hbase hsimply horth i))
        k) := by
  obtain rfl : F = P.orthogonalOrbitSumRealization b σ hbase hsimply horth :=
    Subsingleton.elim _ _
  exact foldedPairing_reflectionPerm_toFoldedIndices P b σ hbase hsimply horth i k

